abstract: "Research framework including SYMBIOSIS-Zero v1.0, an operational pre-pilot framework that is not experimentally validated, not preregistered, and not authorized for participant recruitment. Thresholds, smallest effect sizes of interest, equivalence and non-inferiority margins, and final sample size remain to be fixed after cognitive interviews and pilot work and before preregistration."
